1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,600
Prosecutors say this guy got busted eleven times for the same lie.

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:08,380
Okay, rewind. He's a Florida con man named Anthony.

3
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:11,560
Now, a con man lies so you'll hand over your money.

4
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:13,940
His lie? He's a Saudi prince.

5
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:17,260
You'd think nobody buys that, but look what Miami saw.

6
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:22,160
Step one, a Ferrari with diplomatic plates, the special plates foreign officials get.

7
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:27,760
Step two, bodyguards carrying diplomatic security badges, like actual government agents.

8
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:29,560
Tap the heart if you'd have bought it.

9
00:00:29,560 --> 00:00:33,060
So now he looks rich, and investors trust him with money.

10
00:00:33,720 --> 00:00:36,240
And they ended up losing more than eight million bucks.

11
00:00:36,860 --> 00:00:40,140
Blow a grand every day. You'd be spending about twenty-two years.

12
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:43,060
But the plates were fake, and so were the badges.

13
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:46,320
Send this to the friend who trusts anyone with a nice car.

14
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:49,220
And he kept that act going for about thirty years.

15
00:00:49,680 --> 00:00:51,640
Yeah, longer than a lot of you have been alive.

16
00:00:52,240 --> 00:00:57,180
Remember, prosecutors said he'd been arrested or convicted eleven times for playing royalty.

17
00:00:57,540 --> 00:01:01,420
He pleaded guilty, and he was sentenced to more than eighteen years in prison.

18
00:01:01,940 --> 00:01:04,040
That's a baby growing all the way to graduation.

19
00:01:04,860 --> 00:01:07,600
So how'd he— how'd this dumbass finally slip up?

20
00:01:08,040 --> 00:01:10,000
Follow, the answer's so dumb.

21
00:01:10,420 --> 00:01:12,340
At one dinner, the prince ordered pork.

22
00:01:12,900 --> 00:01:16,580
Problem is, Saudi royals are Muslim, and Islam forbids pork.

23
00:01:16,980 --> 00:01:20,820
So his character would never touch it. A victim noticed, and got suspicious.

24
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:24,860
So what's dumber, the pork, or playing a prince eleven times?

